# Built artifacts. ADR-001 §9 wants a release artifact committed to dist/ and CI
# proving the committed file equals a rebuild. That drift check cannot hold day to
# day while the artifact embeds its own build date, so on working branches dist/ is
# local-only and CI proves reproducibility by building twice in the same run. The
# release commit that pins a version is where a dist/ artifact gets committed —
# open question for Devon/Al, noted in README "Recent changes" 2026-09-17.
dist/
